  <conbody>    <ol>
    <li><p>Lift the load carefully and tilt the mast back a short distance.</p>
      <fig>
            <image href="../media/image789.png"/>
          </fig>
          <p>Typical Example</p></li>
    <li><p>Tilt the mast further back to cradle the load</p>
      <fig>
            <image href="../media/image790.png"/>
          </fig>
          <p>Typical Example</p></li>
    <li>Operate the lift truck in reverse until the load is clear of the other material.</li>
    <li>Lower the cradled load to the travel position.</li>
